msgid "As an alternative to dynamic client registration, you can use the xref:security-oidc-client-id-metadata-document.adoc[OAuth Client ID Metadata Document] support, which allows the authorization server to discover the client configuration by fetching a metadata document from the `client-id` URL without requiring an explicit registration step."
